# Optional local build overrides. Copy to .env — which is gitignored.
#
# NOTHING SECRET BELONGS HERE.
#
# Your notary credential is stored in the macOS keychain by
# `notarytool store-credentials` and is referenced only by profile name.
# An app-specific password written into a file would be strictly less safe
# than where it already lives.

# Only needed if you hold more than one Developer ID certificate.
# Otherwise it is discovered from the keychain automatically.
# DEV_ID=Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID)

# Keychain profile name created by `notarytool store-credentials`.
# NOTARY_PROFILE=smartcharging-notary

# Version stamped into the built disk image.
# VERSION=1.0.0
